{"about_the_game":"Play as Clovelin, a card reader who was convicted as a witch and made a deal with the devil to avenge her own death. With the powers of her magical tarot deck, you will battle the Inquisition and try to destroy their most powerful weapon: the Witchhammer.<br><br><br>To master our real time deckbuilding roguelike you will not only learn how to avoid your enemies attacks but also how to play your cards most efficiently.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/extras/dc5bae4123911c57c1bdf06cc03bc00d.poster.avif?t=1761179364\" width=615 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/extras/dc5bae4123911c57c1bdf06cc03bc00d.webm?t=1761179364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>After every wave of enemies you will improve your deck, making it more powerful and adapting it to your own playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/extras/354ac4e7980bb78f54b686df2b8a439b.poster.avif?t=1761179364\" width=615 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/extras/354ac4e7980bb78f54b686df2b8a439b.webm?t=1761179364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Try to find the best possible combination of spells to massacre your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/extras/2dfce95610baf703b57eaac0e8f41663.poster.avif?t=1761179364\" width=615 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/extras/2dfce95610baf703b57eaac0e8f41663.webm?t=1761179364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2616750?t=1761179364","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/18d224d610e409f5abaf442bed527b1d9ff55185/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761179364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/0e513a9b814fdf57443b5ad46456005b0ff35891/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761179364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/0e513a9b814fdf57443b5ad46456005b0ff35891/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761179364","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game is not a realistic portrait of the violence done during the inquisition but contains comical amounts of blood."},"demos":[{"appid":2797610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Play as Clovelin, a card reader who was convicted as a witch and made a deal with the devil to avenge her own death. With the powers of her magical tarot deck, you will battle the Inquisition and try to destroy their most powerful weapon: the Witchhammer.<br><br><br>To master our real time deckbuilding roguelike you will not only learn how to avoid your enemies attacks but also how to play your cards most efficiently.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/extras/dc5bae4123911c57c1bdf06cc03bc00d.poster.avif?t=1761179364\" width=615 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616750/extras/dc5bae4123911c57c1bdf06cc03bc00d.webm?t=1761179364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></v